+/// Smith Line 769: HIHO balance calculation
+/// 
+/// **Metaphysical Basis:**
+/// - Bailey, Cosmic Fire Ch. 2-3: Electric Fire (Will) + Solar Fire (Love-Wisdom) must blend
+/// - Tesla: 3 (Electric) + 6 (Solar) = 9 (perfect blending when result = 0.5)
+/// - Percival: Triune Self - Truth balances Consciousness and Reality
+/// 
+/// **Smith Reference:** Line 769 - "varying degrees of stability being displayed 
+/// according to how close to the half-in-half-out rule they are"
+/// 
+/// **Formula:** HIHO_Balance = S_out / (S_in + S_out)
+/// **Target:** 0.5 (perfect balance)
+/// **Stability:** 1.0 - |0.5 - balance| (Smith Lines 593-594)
+/// 
+/// **PRD Reference:** v3.0, Section 3.1.1 (Electric Fire Implementation)
+/// **Architecture Reference:** v1.0, Component 4.1 (HIHOBalanceCalculator)
+/// **Epic:** Epic 0 (Rust Foundation)
+/// **Story:** Story 0.2 (Line 769 HIHO Balance)
+/// 
+/// **Performance Target:** <1μs execution (AVX-512 optimized)
+/// **Test Coverage:** 100% (unit tests, benchmarks)
+/// 
+/// # Arguments
+/// * `s_in` - Magnitude of Electric Fire (Half-in, dims 80-99)
+/// * `s_out` - Magnitude of Solar Fire (Half-out, dims 100-119)
+/// 
+/// # Returns
+/// * `HIHOScore` - Balance, distance, stability, magnitudes
+#[inline(always)]
+pub fn smith_hiho_line_769(s_in: f64, s_out: f64) -> f64 {
+    if (s_in + s_out) > 0.0 {
+        s_out / (s_in + s_out)  // Bailey: Three Fires blending
