+/// **Operation:**
+/// Quadrature(state, plane) = 90° rotation in specified plane
+/// Formula: (x, y) → (-y, x) = multiply by i = e^(iπ/2)
+/// Target: 90° rotation (verify 85°-95° tolerance)
